/-! Part 285 (generated by `reports/p285-gen-root.py`): interval-in-n caps for the bias
root of the M2 root route on 15325–16199. `squaredPrice` is antitone in `n` and monotone in
the energy and location errors, so one cap at the left end of a band holds for every
larger `n` and all errors below the band's largest sharp-layer errors (operator cap 183). -/
namespace BstLean.Part285
